(23 sessions flagged buggy code) is work that passes green test gates but b=
reaks the moment you touch it by hand. Asking for an explicit manual-path w=
alkthrough =E2=80=94 real data, real clicks =E2=80=94 before declaring a ro=
und done would catch these before you do.</div>
