sess alone</li><li>Parallel worker fan-out on the capture tool produced dup=
licate type definitions (CaptureSetID, CaptureMode, etc.) that broke the co=
mbined build because shared vocabulary wasn't extracted first; the R22 notc=
h render also missed the reference you'd shared, costing a full R23 fidelit=
y pass</li></ul>
