          <div class=3D"pattern-prompt"><div class=3D"prompt-label">Paste i=
nto Claude Code:</div><code>Before fanning out any parallel workers on this=
 epic, do a contract extraction pass: read the epic/stories, then write `co=
ntracts/shared.ts` (or the language equivalent) containing EVERY type, inte=
rface, enum, and constant that more than one lane will touch, plus a `contr=
acts/OWNERSHIP.md` mapping each file path to exactly one lane. No lane may =
create or redefine anything in shared contracts.

Then:
