 each worktree is fresh (no stale branches, correct HEAD) and print the ver=
ification table before proceeding.
2. Launch the lanes in parallel, each with the contracts file pinned in its=
 prompt and an explicit instruction: 'if you need a new shared type, STOP a=
nd report it rather than defining it.'
