ically for silent failures: decode errors swallowed, empty results treated =
as success, partial writes.
- Agent B: UI destructive-path adversary =E2=80=94 boot the app and actuall=
y click every bulk/destructive/'select all' action, empty states, and max-c=
ardinality states. Screenshot each.
